{"item_uid": "指考97-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1935年，墨索里尼出兵佔領衣索匹亞，消息立刻傳遍義大利。當時民眾最可能\n透過哪一種媒體，即時獲得此一訊息？", "options": {"A": "報紙", "B": "網路", "C": "電視", "D": "廣播"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 83.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 96.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 67.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 83.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 67.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 93.0, 86.0, 78.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "在一份官文書中提到「（本藩）已手闢草昩，與爾文武各官，及各鎮大小將領，\n官兵家眷，盡來胥宇，總必創建田宅等項，以遺子孫計。但一勞永逸，當以己\n力經營，不准混侵土民及百姓現耕物業。茲將條開列於後，咸使遵依。如有違\n越，法在必究，著戶官刻板頒行。」請問這份資料是誰提出來的？主要是實施\n哪項政策？", "options": {"A": "鄭成功到台灣後，為了要解決軍民糧食問題所發的文書", "B": "施琅平定台灣後，為了解決駐台官兵糧食問題發的文書", "C": "沈葆楨為推動新政建設，鼓勵官兵開墾土地所發的文書", "D": "劉銘傳於台灣建省後，鼓勵開墾，並保障原住民的地權"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 33.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 64.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 19.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 20.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 51.0, 37.0, 27.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "荷蘭聯合東印度公司曾於1624到1662年間占領台灣，建立殖民政權。1662年，\n鄭成功才驅逐荷蘭人，建立明鄭政權。這兩個政權經營台灣時，有何相似之處？", "options": {"A": "為解決糧食不足的問題，均將土地收歸公有", "B": "均對原住民採安撫政策，不採武力征服策略", "C": "均重視對外貿易，尤其對日本、南洋之貿易", "D": "為充裕府庫，均在台灣各地開港，並抽重稅"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 62.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 67.0, 64.0, 59.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某一時期，一群青年在全台各地舉辦講習會，推廣法律、衞生等觀念，也用戲\n劇、電影、音樂會等方式傳播新知。這是下列哪個時期的活動？", "options": {"A": "1900年代日本慶祝在台始政，組織青年服務隊，以推廣新知，改善陋習", "B": "1920年代台籍知識份子成立的台灣文化協會，積極從事文化的啓蒙工作", "C": "1960年代青年反共救國團，因中共文化大革命，發起中華文化復興運動", "D": "1990年代青年受天安門事件的影響，發動野百合學運從事社會改革運動"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 56.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 66.0, 55.0, 46.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "右圖是一幅根據國際貿易比重為指標所繪製的變形東亞地圖。這幅圖反映的應\n為哪一段時間的情況？", "options": {"A": "1950年代初期 南 韓 日", "B": "1960年代中期 中華人民\n共和國", "C": "1980年代初期\n香港", "D": "1990年代後期 中 本\n華\n民\n國\n馬來西亞\n新加坡 菲\n律\n賓\n- 1 -\n97年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 28.0, "p_value": 27.0, "p_high": 38.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [43.0, 30.0, 24.0, 20.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位作家說：「這裡的台灣人都是具有雙重身份，一邊放著中國政府給的居住\n證明，一邊放著日本發的配給票。」這應是何時何地的情況？", "options": {"A": "1905年的台北", "B": "1940年的北京", "C": "1965年的東京", "D": "1990年的上海"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 58.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 53.0, "B": 40.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 57.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 40.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [47.0, 27.0, 20.0, 18.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "歐洲曾有一位富有的公爵因反抗壓迫，遭政府處死，激發當地人民起來反對統\n治者。後來一位文學家以此故事為主題，寫了一個劇本，音樂家也將之譜成歌\n劇公演，贏得觀眾熱烈迴響，視這位公爵為民族英雄。這種劇本與歌劇創作及\n觀眾的反應，是哪一種思潮的展現？", "options": {"A": "寫實主義", "B": "保守主義", "C": "理性主義", "D": "浪漫主義"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 61.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 53.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 57.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 79.0, 63.0, 45.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一份條約指出：「朝鮮國為自主之邦，保有與日本國平等之權。……兩國文書\n往來，日本用其國文，自今起十年間，別具漢譯文一本，朝鮮用其本國文字。」\n又說朝鮮應開口岸，讓日本商人貿易，「日本國人民在朝鮮國指定各口，如因\n犯罪而與朝鮮國人民發生糾紛，皆歸日本官審斷。」這一份條約簽訂的時機應\n當是：", "options": {"A": "1876年，日本開始明治維新後，向朝鮮擴張時", "B": "1895年，中日戰爭後，日本控制朝鮮半島之際", "C": "1905年，日俄戰爭後，日本勢力進入中國之後", "D": "1945年，日本投降，與朝鮮訂立和平條約之時"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 15.0, "p_high": 20.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 8.0, "p_quintiles": [21.0, 17.0, 14.0, 13.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1555年，一位西方領袖下令：除非另有許可，僧侶必須立刻返回修道院，所有\n隨意遊蕩的僧侶都將遭逮捕；修道院不得再向不在職的官員提供獻金，教會所\n有部門必須減少開支；任命聖職時，如涉及買賣嫌疑，一律禁止。我們如何解\n釋這樣的現象？", "options": {"A": "羅馬教宗受宗教分裂刺激，決心整頓教會", "B": "英國國王對羅馬教宗不滿，限制教會活動", "C": "法國國王不願受教會控制，禁止宗教發展", "D": "神聖羅馬帝國皇帝要強化教會，清除異端"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 50.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 73.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 66.0, 52.0, 35.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1880年代，一位台灣官員向政府指陳：為達「方便商務，振興經濟，貫穿南北，\n裨於海防，輸送兵員，防止變亂」之目的，希望能進行此一重大建設。請問：\n此重大建設所指為何？", "options": {"A": "興建貫穿南北的公路系統", "B": "廣建港口以建立環島航運", "C": "疏竣南北河川以開鑿運河", "D": "興建貫穿南北的鐡路系統"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 63.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 72.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 67.0, 64.0, 60.0, 48.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位學者介紹某地豐富的文化資產時，將該地從古以來的宗教信仰比喻成一座\n房屋。他說：最下層居住的是法老，上一層是亞伯拉罕，再上面一層是基督，\n最上面一層則是阿拉。這是何地的情況？", "options": {"A": "開羅", "B": "麥加", "C": "大馬士革", "D": "君士坦丁堡"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 46.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 78.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 47.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 64.0, 42.0, 25.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "資料記載：元月十五日時，京城中幾個主要佛寺競相舉辦法會，吸引人群；大\n街上百姓提燈遊行，爭奇鬥豔，四處張燈結綵，好不熱鬧。皇帝特地下詔，當\n天京城大街特許夜行，官府不加取締。這段文字描述的景象最可能發生於何時？", "options": {"A": "漢代", "B": "唐代", "C": "宋代", "D": "清代\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 97年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 67.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 89.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 82.0, 70.0, 55.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "古代萊茵河下游某一城市，由於人口眾多，為解決居住問題，拆毀部分城牆。\n但四世紀初，突然從附近鄉間湧入大量人口，這個城市又重新修復城牆，興建\n碉樓和防禦工事。導致這種情況發生的最可能原因為何？", "options": {"A": "北歐維京人入侵", "B": "日耳曼部落入侵", "C": "斯拉夫民族入侵", "D": "阿拉伯各部入侵"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 75.0, 64.0, 53.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "中國歷史上，長城一向是防範游牧民族南侵的屏障，但某位皇帝認為長城已失\n去防禦功能，決定此後不再維修，終其統治期間，與蒙古各部結盟。這是哪位\n皇帝的作法？", "options": {"A": "宋太祖", "B": "遼太宗", "C": "明成祖", "D": "清聖祖"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 42.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 71.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 26.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 54.0, 36.0, 25.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位學者認為唐宋時期江南曾經實施稻麥輪種制，並欲引用白居易任職蘇州時\n寫的詩句：「去年到郡日，麥穗黃離離；今年去郡日，稻花白霏霏」證明自己\n的說法。關於這位學者的看法，以下說明何者較為合理？", "options": {"A": "詩裡提到麥作、稻作，足以作為稻麥輪種的佐證", "B": "詩中指出稻、麥產於不同季節，足以說明輪種制", "C": "詩中並未指明稻、麥產自同一塊土地，不足為據", "D": "詩人的描述多不精確，不適合運用在歷史的討論"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 38.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 37.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 39.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 32.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [34.0, 28.0, 24.0, 19.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "小說裡有這樣的情節：幾個年輕人被地方官員逮捕後，一名傳教士進入知府衙\n門，向知府表示「傳教的人原本與地方公事無干涉，但這幾個人都是我們教會\n裡的朋友，立刻把這幾個人交我帶去。」知府明知這幾個人是指明要捉拿的會\n黨，不便交給教士帶走，卻又擔心教士寫信託公使到總理衙門理論，只好將人\n交給教士。這個故事的背景是：", "options": {"A": "明朝末年的杭州", "B": "清朝初年的北京", "C": "清朝末年的上海", "D": "民國初年的南京"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 92.0, 83.0, 67.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "第二次世界大戰後，許多殖民地尋求獨立時，往往遭「殖民母國」阻撓。下列\n何國獨立時，曾與原殖民國發生過激烈的武裝衝突？", "options": {"A": "印度", "B": "越南", "C": "埃及", "D": "南非"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 47.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 59.0, 51.0, 49.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某地舉辦地方議會議員選舉，當時該地人口185,594人，經登記而有選舉權者\n僅有7,195人。選舉時，投票率高達九成以上，順利完成。請問這場選舉於何\n時何地舉行？", "options": {"A": "1895年的倫敦", "B": "1915年的東京", "C": "1935年的台北", "D": "1950年的開普敦"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 36.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 27.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 37.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 17.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 50.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 37.0, 26.0, 20.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "近代以來華南虎瀕臨滅絕，但學者研究指出：長江以南地區，宋代以後虎患漸\n趨頻繁，至明清尤盛，且較集中發生在閩、贛、粵等省交界處的山區。明清時\n期，上述地區虎患盛行的可能原因是：", "options": {"A": "氣候變遷導致老虎出山覓食", "B": "以虎骨等入藥的風氣漸盛", "C": "人口增加導致山區過度開發", "D": "國內旅遊的風氣逐漸形成"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 95.0, 92.0, 87.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有歷史學家認為，能夠綜合國王制、貴族制和民主制的優良因素的政體才是最\n好的政體，因為同時具有類似王權的執行權，貴族的諮詢權和人民的同意權，\n最能確保政權的穩定。最能符合這種構想的是：", "options": {"A": "西元前六世紀的波斯", "B": "西元前三世紀的羅馬", "C": "十七世紀後半的法國", "D": "十八世紀初的俄羅斯\n- 3 -\n97年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 45.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 61.0, 47.0, 36.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有一幅畫作的主題是五位仕女：她們的稜角分明，好像是用斧頭砍出來的，透\n視法和明暗對比都為平面所代替。這些平面表示一種空間感和實在感，不使畫\n布顯得空虛。右邊兩個人物的頭部嚴重變形，其中一人的鼻子在臉上折成扁平\n的，同時自幾個不同的觀點描繪對象。這幅畫最可能是哪一位畫家的作品？", "options": {"A": "十七世紀中葉的林布蘭", "B": "十九世紀後半的梵谷", "C": "十九世紀末的雷諾瓦", "D": "二十世紀初的畢卡索"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 85.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 71.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 71.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 88.0, 81.0, 66.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有人描述：漢口不僅為湖北一地之咽喉，雲、貴、川、桂、湘諸地之貨皆於此\n轉輸東下，成為當時天下「四聚」之一。此處有關漢口的描述，最可能的時代\n背景是：", "options": {"A": "南朝偏安江南局勢下的物資轉輸", "B": "唐代的經濟重心轉移至長江流域", "C": "兩宋時長江中游加速開發的結果", "D": "明清長江中下游之間的經濟分工"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 48.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 23.0, "p_value": 25.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 9.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 32.0, 18.0, 11.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "上課時，老師希望同學對十九世紀英國怡和洋行淡水分行的歷史做一小論文，\n要求同學自行蒐集材料，以便閱讀。有四位同學各自提出選擇材料的構想。下\n列哪位同學的構想應最能掌握怡和洋行的歷史？", "options": {"A": "甲生想以該洋行的檔案為主要材料，因為這些檔案最能說明當時公司的營運", "B": "乙生想利用該洋行職員的回憶錄，因為這是當事人留下的一手報導，最可信", "C": "丙生想訪談淡水地區的耆老，因為這些人目睹洋行營運，所做的口述最翔實", "D": "丁生想以當時各種報章雜誌為主要材料，藉以瞭解並掌握該公司的不同風貌"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 39.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 51.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 27.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 51.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [56.0, 44.0, 40.0, 34.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "中國學者使用出土文物研究歷史的起源甚早，但某一時期中，不僅發掘許多器\n物，同時還有大量文書出土，益發引起學者重視，主張結合出土文物與文獻來\n研究古代歷史。這種風氣盛行於何時？", "options": {"A": "魏晉南北朝時，因許多文物出土，引發新研究風潮", "B": "宋代，學者用金石資料補正年月、官爵等相關史實", "C": "乾嘉時期，考據學家用古器物及金石資料研究歷史", "D": "清末民初，學者運用古籍文物等資料考訂中國歷史"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 37.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 59.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 59.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 42.0, 30.0, 24.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位學者指出，這場戰爭「抹煞了一千年來的日耳曼人、波蘭人、立陶宛人不\n斷征服與殖民的影響，而使得種族地圖又恢復到西元1200年以前的情形。」他\n指的是一場造成約2000萬人大遷徙的戰爭。這場戰爭是：", "options": {"A": "1618到1648年的三十年戰爭", "B": "1802年到1815年間的拿破崙戰爭", "C": "1870年到1871年的德法戰爭", "D": "1939年到1945年第二次世界大戰"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 21.0, "p_value": 25.0, "p_high": 38.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [42.0, 29.0, 23.0, 17.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "下表是某個地區的人口估計數字，這樣的人口變化最可能發生在下列哪個地區？\n白人 黑人＋混血 原住民\n1490 0 0 50,000,000\n1570 138,000 共260,000 9,700,000\n1650 725,000 815,000＋644,000 9,105,000\n1825 4,349,000 4,188,000＋6,252,000 8,211,300", "options": {"A": "拉丁美洲", "B": "澳洲", "C": "南非", "D": "大洋洲\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 97年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 78.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 91.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 64.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 78.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 85.0, 78.0, 73.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "清代主流學術原為考據學，中期以後轉變為講求權宜救亂的經世致用之學。此\n轉變之主因為何？", "options": {"A": "反清復明思想復熾，學者轉趨宋明理學以替代考據學", "B": "內亂始作，外患亦接踵而至，春秋經世思想隨之代興", "C": "西方學術傳入後，學者趨之若鶩，考據學因此而衰微", "D": "取才方式轉變，科舉廢除，舊學為新時代士人所遺棄"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 70.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 56.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 89.0, 78.0, 57.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "台灣曾經有幾座戰俘營，監禁一些英國、澳洲及荷蘭的軍官與士兵。許多士兵\n被迫在礦場勞動，在山中伐木。這些戰俘的來源應當是：", "options": {"A": "1860年英法聯軍之役中被俘虜的官兵", "B": "1917年日本與德國開戰時虜獲的官兵", "C": "1942年日本在東南亞戰區俘虜的戰俘", "D": "1972年越戰期間台灣收容的各國戰俘"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 91.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 84.0, 70.0, 55.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某個時期學術思潮發生重大變化，不僅逐漸形成強調個體、重視個性解放的文\n學風氣，文學脫離了經學而獲得獨立；另一方面，史學也不再是經學之附庸，\n形成了後來正史經籍志裡經史子集的圖書分類方式。這應是指哪個時代？", "options": {"A": "秦漢", "B": "魏晉", "C": "唐宋", "D": "明清"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 68.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 53.0, 39.0, 28.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位歷史學者指出，有段時期中，歐洲某地工商業發展和都市化的程度，只有\n法蘭德斯可相提並論。當地沒有完全封建化，世襲貴族還要受到商人階級的約\n束；富有冒險犯難精神的商人遍布各地，與猶太人、埃及人、波斯人、阿拉伯\n人，甚至印度人及中國人往來。某地是指：", "options": {"A": "2世紀時的希臘", "B": "8世紀的拜占庭", "C": "14世紀的義大利", "D": "18世紀的法國"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 75.0, 60.0, 44.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1938年以後，幾個歐洲國家來的移民突然湧入上海，他們來自不同的社會階\n層，從事不同的職業，使用不同的語言，卻有共同的宗教信仰。他們在上海建\n立社區，發行報紙。戰爭結束後，他們離開上海，移往歐美各地。他們共同的\n信仰是：", "options": {"A": "基督教", "B": "伊斯蘭教", "C": "猶太教", "D": "天主教"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 44.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 41.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 46.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 12.0, "p_high": 25.0, "p_low": 5.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [31.0, 13.0, 7.0, 5.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1846年，中國某地一家飯店開業，因地點相當偏僻，交通不便，初期的經營狀\n況不佳。19世紀後期，該飯店卻成了中國最早接受現代事物的場所：1867年，\n該飯店最早使用煤氣；1882年安裝電燈，引來許多好奇的人潮；1883年，最早\n使用自來水。這個飯店應位於何處？", "options": {"A": "北京", "B": "上海", "C": "天津", "D": "澳門"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 11.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 72.0, 62.0, 49.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位哲人主張：人類應當擺脫自身的不成熟，學習有效地運用自己的理解能\n力，並且勇於認知。哲人這樣的主張最可能屬於下列何種思潮：", "options": {"A": "自由主義", "B": "存在主義", "C": "理性主義", "D": "浪漫主義"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 80.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 12.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 83.0, 81.0, 78.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "中國史上，曾有西北邊境官員向朝廷報告緊急軍情，皇帝即刻召集宰相及相關\n長官共商對策。由於宰相無權調動軍隊，乃由主管軍事的長官提出作戰方案，\n由主管財政的長官調度後勤物資，經皇帝裁決後，才調動軍隊增援前線。以上\n場景最可能發生於何時：", "options": {"A": "漢代匈奴侵入山西", "B": "唐代吐蕃入侵河西", "C": "宋代西夏入寇陝西", "D": "明代蒙古入侵河套\n- 5 -\n97年指考 第 6 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 79.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 66.0, 48.0, 32.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
